Looking at this problem, I need to find:
$$\lim_{n \to \infty} E\left[\left(E\left[\sqrt{\frac{X}{n} + \frac{1}{2}} \,\Big|\, U\right]\right)^2\right]$$
where $X|U \sim \text{Poisson}(U)$ and $U \sim \chi^2_n$.

